    "#_Delivers_NULL_REGION"            ,"UNKNOWN REGION"   ,"#_Delivers"   ,"Same Orders but without assigned region"
    "Item_Sold_MIENBAC"                 ,"MIENBAC"          ,"Item_Sold"    ,"Count the number of items sold in the MIENBAC region. The total items sold is the total_item field in the marketplace orders table. But in tender  item_sold is the count of distinct product_id from the order_items table"
    "Item_Sold_MIENTRUNG"               ,"MIENTRUNG"        ,"Item_Sold"    ,"Count the number of items sold in the MIENTRUNG region"
